      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹恐怕是……\n不、确凿无疑，她是一个\n身体相当结实，并且内心强大的孩子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90d887449e7008dd761975cae620463b298d6bfe7496e70839f6d9019e71ae1c",
